sequenceDiagram
    participant Shopper
    participant Page as Web page
    participant App as FastAPI app
    participant Pipe as Pipeline
    participant Model as DTD ResNet-50
    participant Rend as Renderer
    participant Log as SessionLog
    Shopper->>Page: Choose garment photo
    Page->>App: POST /api/analyse (image)
    App->>Pipe: analyse(image)
    Pipe->>Model: classify(image)
    Model-->>Pipe: ranked textile classes
    Pipe->>Pipe: look up descriptor for top class
    Pipe->>Rend: encode patterns A-D and fidelity
    Rend-->>Pipe: patterns and fidelity scores
    Pipe-->>App: result with timings
    App-->>Page: JSON (class, waveform, spectrum, patterns)
    Page-->>Shopper: show waveform, spectrum and top-3 classes
    Shopper->>Page: Tap Play
    Page->>Page: navigator.vibrate(pattern)
    Page-->>Shopper: phone vibrates
    Page->>App: POST /api/latency (timings)
    App->>Log: append latency record
    Page->>App: POST /api/session (device model)
    App->>Log: append session record
